---
/**
 * Unnumbered margin note (marked with ⊕ on narrow screens). Same usage rules
 * as <Sidenote>: keep it inline with the surrounding text.
 */
---
<span class="sn"><label class="sn-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="margin-toggle" aria-label="Show note" /><span class="sn-num mn-num"></span></label><span class="marginnote" role="note"><slot /></span></span>
